# ---------------------------------------------------------------
#  NEVER COMMIT SECRETS OR LIVE DATA
# ---------------------------------------------------------------
# The whole data/ folder is ignored on purpose. It holds:
#   .secrets.json  -> MASTER_KEY + SESSION_SECRET (server-only)
#   db.json        -> users, password hashes, ENCRYPTED API keys/tokens
#   db.backup*.json / db.pre-upgrade-*.json -> snapshots of the same
#   outbox/        -> password-recovery emails
# The app recreates data/ automatically on first run.
data/

# Environment variables (real values). The example file is safe to commit.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# Keys / certificates, just in case
*.pem
*.key
*.p12
*.pfx

# ---------------------------------------------------------------
#  Build / runtime artefacts
# ---------------------------------------------------------------
node_modules/
public/generated/
*.log
npm-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*

# ---------------------------------------------------------------
#  Editor / OS / tooling
# ---------------------------------------------------------------
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
.vscode/
.idea/
.claude/settings.local.json
.vercel/
